# fixture: the guide's coord scene, the yes/no loop and a starter choice by d-pad; ends idle so the
# save round-trip runs.
# Timings (real World/VM, 30 Hz): map loads fade 8 ticks; walk 8 ticks per tile; a new direction first
# turns (2 ticks); text prints 1 char per 2 ticks; the guide's "!" lasts 30 ticks.
#
# new game: spawn in the room; the onFrame intro starts once the fade-in ends
0 assert map fixture:ROOM
0 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 16
12 assert message open
80 press a
82 release a
86 assert message closed
# to the exit mat, then push down into the door warp
90 press right
94 release right
110 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 16
110 press down
130 release down
150 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 19
150 press down
152 release down
170 assert map fixture:TOWN
# the town door (10,13) opens under the fade in; the player walks out of it, south, and it closes (until 180)
170 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 14
# down to the path row, then east along it into the coord trigger (x 38)
170 press down
190 release down
200 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 16
200 press right
422 release right
426 assert position fixture:TOWN 38 16
# the scene: the guide walks up from 44,16; two message pages
430 assert message closed
590 assert message open
600 press a
602 release a
606 assert message open
730 press a
732 release a
# the starter panel (touch screen); the message box is closed
740 assert message closed
740 press a
742 release a
# picked slot 0; "Is this the one you want?" + yes/no: answer No (down, A) → back to the panel
800 assert message open
810 press down
812 release down
820 press a
822 release a
830 assert message closed
# cursor to slot 1 with the d-pad, pick it, answer Yes (A on the default cursor)
830 press down
832 release down
840 press a
842 release a
900 assert message open
910 press a
912 release a
916 assert party 0 fixture:SPECIES_EMBERKIT
916 assert var fixture:VAR_PLAYER_STARTER 2
# "Take good care of it" → A; the guide walks back east and the scene ends
990 press a
992 release a
1040 assert message closed
1040 assert var fixture:VAR_SCENE 1
1040 assert position fixture:TOWN 38 16
